{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01JWbUPqBy5mzQjyjLnjVPSU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Here's a summary of everything done:\n\n## Summary\n\nAll phases of the monorepo migration plan have been implemented in `source/hankweave/`:\n\n**Phase 1 - Docs workspace setup:**\n- Copied `hankweave-docs/nextra-site/*` into `docs/`\n- Deleted `docs/bun.lock` (will be managed by root lockfile)\n- Added `\"workspaces\": [\"docs\"]` to root `package.json`\n- Ran `bun install` → generated unified lockfile (1614 packages)\n\n**Phase 2 - Cross-repo references:**\n- Added `\"docs/**/*\"` to `tsconfig.json` `exclude` array (prevents TS compiler picking up incompatible docs files)\n- Updated `generate-schemas.ts` `DOCS_SCHEMA_DIR` path from `../../hankweave-docs/nextra-site/public/schemas` to `../docs/public/schemas`\n- Updated the `docsAvailable` comment to reflect the new always-present nature in monorepo\n\n**Phase 3 - Strip lists:**\n- `sync-public.ts`: Added `\"docs\"` to `STRIP_DIRS`; added `delete pkg.workspaces` to `transformPackageJson()`\n- `release.ts`: Added `\"docs/\"` to `INTERNAL_FILES_TO_STRIP`; extended schema diff check, revert, and `git add` to cover `docs/public/schemas/`\n- `test-sync-local.ts`: Added `--exclude='docs'` to rsync; added `\"docs\"` to `shouldNotExist` list\n\n**Phase 4 - `.gitignore`:** Added `docs/.next/`, `docs/out/`, and `docs/public/_pagefind/` entries\n\n**Phase 5 - SOP:** Updated repo structure diagram, strip list documentation, `package.json` transform description, key files table, and added a Documentation site subsection to Section 3\n\n**Verification results:**\n- Lint: clean (230 files, no issues)\n- Schema generation: writes correctly to both `schemas/` and `docs/public/schemas/`\n- npm pack: `docs/` correctly excluded from tarball\n- Tests: same 9 pre-existing failures (Codex binary not found) — not migration-related"}],"stop_reas